1
00:05:26,666 --> 00:05:32,666
Not Your Parent’s Opera

2
00:10:53,333 --> 00:10:59,333
Repo! The Genetic Opera is a horror, science fiction,
music film directed by Darren Lynn Bousman.

3
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:26,000
By the year 2056, an epidemic of organ failures has devastated the planet.

4
00:21:46,666 --> 00:21:52,666
The megacorporation GeneCo provides organ transplants on a payment plan - and
those who can’t fulfill their plans have their organs repossessed.

5
00:27:13,333 --> 00:27:19,333
In the midst of this, a sickly teenager discovers a shocking secret
about herself, her father, and their connection to GeneCo.

6
00:32:40,000 --> 00:32:46,000
Shilo Wallace, played by Alexa PenaVega.

7
00:38:06,666 --> 00:38:12,666
Rotti Largo, played by Paul Sorvino.

8
00:43:33,333 --> 00:43:39,333
Nathan Wallace / Repo Man, played by Anthony Stewart Head.

9
00:49:00,000 --> 00:49:06,000
Blind Mag, played by Sarah Brightman.

10
00:54:26,666 --> 00:54:32,666
Amber Sweet, played by Paris Hilton.

11
00:59:53,333 --> 00:59:59,333
Luigi Largo, played by Bill Moseley.

12
01:05:20,000 --> 01:05:26,000
The Genetic Opera is a 2008 American musical film.

13
01:10:46,666 --> 01:10:52,666
Described as a gothic rock opera, the film was directed by Darren Lynn Bousman and based on the 2002
stage musical of the same name, written and composed by Darren Smith and Terrance Zdunich.

14
01:16:13,333 --> 01:16:19,333
It stars Alexa Vega, Anthony Stewart Head, Sarah Brightman, Paris Hilton,
Nivek Ogre, Terrance Zdunich, Bill Moseley, and Paul Sorvino.

15
01:21:40,000 --> 01:21:46,000
premiered at the Fantasia Film Festival in July 2008, followed by a limited
release on November 7, 2008, on seven screens in various cities.

16
01:27:06,666 --> 01:27:12,666
The film explores themes of jealousy, dystopia, drug
addiction, heir to the throne, gore.

17
01:32:33,333 --> 01:32:39,333
The tone is dark and thought_provoking.
